					</script></div><ul id="top" class="accessibleLinks"><li><a href="#content">Skip to main content</a></li><li><a href="#plainViewNav">Skip to navigation</a></li></ul><div id="layout1"><div id="header"><h2><img alt="Legislation.gov.uk" src="/images/chrome/plainViewHeaderTitle.gif" /></h2><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/contents">Back to full view</a></div><div id="background"></div><div id="layout2"><h1 id="pageTitle" class="pageTitle">Housing Grants, Construction and Regeneration Act 1996</h1><div class="interface" id="plainViewNav"></div><div id="content"><div id="viewLegContents" xml:lang="en"><div class="LegSnippet" id="tocControlsAdded"><div class="LegContents LegClearFix"><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/introduction">Introductory Text</a></span></p></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPart tocDefaultExpanded   "><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I">Part I  Grants, &amp;c. for renewal of private sector housing</a></p><ol><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsChapter"><p class="LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I">Chapter I  The main grants</a></p><ol><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/introductory"> Introductory</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/1">1.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/1"> Grants for improvements and repairs, &amp;c.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/2">2.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/2"> Applications for grants.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/preliminary-conditions"> Preliminary conditions</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/3">3.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/3">Ineligible applicants.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/4">4.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/4"> The age of the property.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/5">5.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/5"> Excluded descriptions of works.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/6">6.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/6"> Defective dwellings.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/renovation-grants"> Renovation grants</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/7">7.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/7"> Renovation grants: owner’s applications and tenant’s applications.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/8">8.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/8"> Renovation grants: certificates required in case of owner’s application.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/9">9.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/9"> Renovation grants: certificates required in case of tenant’s application.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/10">10.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/10"> Renovation grants: prior qualifying period.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/11">11.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/11"> Prior qualifying period: the ownership or tenancy condition.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/12">12.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/12"> Renovation grants: purposes for which grant may be given.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/13">13.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/13"> Renovation grants: approval of application.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/common-parts-grants"> Common parts grants</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/14">14.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/14"> Common parts grants: occupation of flats by occupying tenants.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/15">15.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/15"> Common parts grants: landlord’s and tenants’ applications.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/16">16.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/16"> Common parts grants: certificate required to accompany application.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/17">17.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/17"> Common parts grants: purposes for which grant may be given.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/18">18.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/18"> Common parts grants: approval of application.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/disabled-facilities-grants"> Disabled facilities grants</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/19">19.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/19"> Disabled facilities grants: owner’s and tenant’s applications.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/20">20.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/20"> Disabled facilities grants: the disabled occupant.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/21">21.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/21"> Disabled facilities grants: certificate required in case of owner’s application.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/22">22.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/22"> Disabled facilities grants: certificates required in case of tenant’s application.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/22A">22A.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/22A">Certificates required in case of occupier’s application</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/23">23.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/23"> Disabled facilities grants: purposes for which grant must or may be given.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/24">24.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/24"> Disabled facilities grants: approval of application.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/hmo-grants"> HMO grants</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/25">25.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/25"> HMO grants: the interest of the applicant in the property.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/26">26.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/26"> HMO grants: certificate required to accompany application.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/27">27.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/27"> HMO grants: purposes for which grant may be given.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/28">28.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/28"> HMO grants: approval of application.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/restrictions-on-grant-aid"> Restrictions on grant aid</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/29">29.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/29"> Restriction on grants for works already begun.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/30">30.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/30"> Means testing in case of application by owner-occupier or tenant.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/31">31.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/31"> Determination of amount of grant in case of landlord’s application.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/32">32.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/32"> Apportionment in case of tenants’ application for common parts grant.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/33">33.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/33"> Power to specify maximum amount of grant.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/decision-and-notification"> Decision and notification</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/34">34.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/34"> Decision and notification.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/payment-of-grants"> Payment of grants</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/35">35.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/35"> Payment of grants: general.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/36">36.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/36"> Delayed payment of mandatory grant.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/37">37.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/37"> Payment of grants: conditions as to carrying out of the works.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry LegConfersPower"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/38">38.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/38"> Payment of grants: conditions as to contractors employed.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/39">39.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/39"> Payment of grant to contractor.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/40">40.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/40"> Applicant ceasing to be entitled before payment of grant.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/41">41.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/41"> Change of circumstances affecting disabled occupant.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/42">42.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/42"> Cases in which grants may be re-calculated, withheld or repaid.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/43">43.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/43"> Repayment where applicant not entitled to grant.</a></span></p></li></ol></li><li class="LegClearFix LegContentsPblock"><p class="LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/part/I/chapter/I/crossheading/grant-conditions-and-repayment"> Grant conditions and repayment</a></p><ol><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/44">44.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/44"> Grant conditions: introductory.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/45">45.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/45"> Condition for repayment on disposal: renovation grants.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/46">46.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/46"> Condition for repayment on disposal: common parts grants.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/47">47.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/47"> Condition for repayment on disposal: HMO grants.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/48">48.</a></span><span class="LegDS LegContentsTitle"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/48"> Condition as to owner-occupation: renovation grants.</a></span></p></li><li class="LegContentsEntry"><p class="LegContentsItem LegClearFix"><span class="LegDS LegContentsNo"><a href="/ukpga/1996/53/section/49">49.</a></span><span